WEBVTT

01:01:58.585 --> 01:02:00.145
but it's really not realistic.

01:02:00.169 --> 01:02:03.688
I think they have to look realistically
at the examples I gave

01:02:03.712 --> 01:02:05.204
and see what they can do.

01:02:05.228 --> 01:02:06.387
CA: And at any rate,

01:02:06.411 --> 01:02:10.155
there probably isn't a more urgent public
debate in those countries than that,

01:02:10.179 --> 01:02:12.981
because the train
is going to move pretty fast.

01:02:13.005 --> 01:02:14.617
I think people listening to this

01:02:14.641 --> 01:02:18.832
just have so many different thoughts
of excitement, interest,

01:02:18.856 --> 01:02:20.705
horror, fear, concern.

01:02:20.729 --> 01:02:24.221
What idea would you want
to plant in people's minds

01:02:24.245 --> 01:02:26.055
as you think about AI in the future

01:02:26.079 --> 01:02:28.995
that you just want people to hold on to,

01:02:29.019 --> 01:02:30.843
if there was one they could focus on?